---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Terms & Colophon | 5 Spices or Less" 
  description="Editorial disclaimer, intellectual property, and colophon notes for 5 Spices or Less."
>
  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    
    {/* Page Header */}
    <header class="mb-14 pb-8 border-b border-sand-200 dark:border-ink-800">
      <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-berry-600 dark:text-berry-400 font-semibold block mb-3">
        Colophon & Terms
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-900 dark:text-white leading-tight">
        A quiet understanding.
      </h1>
      <p class="font-serif text-lg text-ink-700 dark:text-stone-300 mt-4 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        This platform is built on simple principles, mutual courtesy, and unvarnished honesty. Here is how intellectual property, editorial opinions, and your privacy are treated.
      </p>
    </header>

    {/* Narrative Content */}
    <div class="space-y-12 font-serif text-lg text-ink-800 dark:text-stone-200 leading-relaxed">
      
      {/* 1. Intellectual Property */}
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink-950 dark:text-white font-serif">
          1. Intellectual Property & Original Work
        </h2>
        <p>
          Every essay, letter, operating framework (including <em>The Five Essentials</em>), and architectural line sketch published across <strong>5 Spices or Less</strong> is the original intellectual property of Vivek Shukla, unless specifically credited otherwise.
        </p>
        <p>
          You are welcome to quote brief passages, share essays with colleagues, or send links with proper attribution. However, whole-cloth republication, commercial redistribution, translation for profit, or the ingesting of these writings into automated data pools or AI model training datasets without prior written consent is strictly prohibited.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 2. Editorial Disclaimer */}
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink-950 dark:text-white font-serif">
          2. Editorial Perspectives & Advisory Scope
        </h2>
        <p>
          The stories, operational lessons, and culinary reflections shared on this platform are drawn directly from thirty years of enterprise building, category pioneering, and life at the stove. They reflect personal conviction and lived experience.
        </p>
        <p>
          They do not constitute certified legal, tax, or investment advice. When we work together under private advisory, our guidance is tailored to your venture's operational context, but fiduciary, statutory, and board decisions remain solely with company directors and founders.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 3. Privacy & Cookies */}
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink-950 dark:text-white font-serif">
          3. Privacy & Cookieless Publishing
        </h2>
        <p>
          We believe the web should be quiet and respectful. This site does not run invasive tracking pixels, behavioural profiling scripts, or third-party ad networks. We do not store persistent tracking cookies on your machine.
        </p>
        <p>
          Any analytics in place are strictly cookieless and aggregated to measure basic reader interest without identifying individuals. If you write to us through an advisory form, your details remain strictly confidential and are never shared or sold.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 4. Colophon */}
      <section class="space-y-4 pt-6 border-t border-sand-200 dark:border-ink-800">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink-950 dark:text-white font-serif">
          4. Colophon
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base text-ink-600 dark:text-stone-400">
          Typeset in <strong>Fraunces</strong>, <strong>Plus Jakarta Sans</strong>, and <strong>JetBrains Mono</strong>. Built with Astro and Tailwind CSS. Hosted statically from Kuala Lumpur.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
